# The bare service name, which is what a cluster-internal caller writes and
# what the resolver expands in its own namespace -- so this component works
# wherever it is deployed rather than only in `default`.
#
# Naming it here is what makes it writable as an egress rule at all: the
# validator refuses a host with no dot unless an operator opened it, which is
# the same list the gateway connects against. Both tiers read it.
